# 换行与二进制文件约定
#
# core.autocrlf=true（本项目开发机默认）：工作区 CRLF、仓库内 LF。
# 这里只声明「哪些是二进制、不要做文本转换」，不强制 eol，避免 checkout 后
# 整个目录因为换行符变成 modified。
* text=auto

# 二进制：图片、权重、索引、压缩包
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.bin binary
*.safetensors binary
*.faiss binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.h5 binary
*.pdf binary

# Word/Excel 等（如果以后放进来）
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
